  "notes": "## 0.4.0-alpha.9 - 2026-04-09\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fixed a visible border artifact around the Quick Panel on Windows and improved spacing between the history list and preview pane.\n- Fixed stale preview content briefly flashing when reopening the Quick Panel.\n- Improved navigation smoothness in the Quick Panel and reduced unnecessary preview loading so previews feel more consistent in both the main window and Quick Panel.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.4.0-alpha.9 - 2026-04-09\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复了 Windows 上快捷面板边缘偶发可见边框的问题，并优化了历史列表与预览区域之间的间距。\n- 修复了重新打开快捷面板时旧预览内容短暂闪现的问题。\n- 提升了快捷面板的导航流畅度，并减少不必要的预览加载，让主窗口和快捷面板中的预览响应更稳定。",
